  "matching": "TRAILING_MAX_SENTINEL",
  "entries": [
    {
      "ordinal": 0,
      "label": "gym_esper_040_receptionist_00",
      "hash64": "1F919632251A1EC8",
      "text": "[VAR 0x0100(0000)]，\\n欢迎你来到焙固道馆。",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 0,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0100",
          "args_hex": [
            "0000"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 1,
      "label": "gym_esper_040_receptionist_01",
      "hash64": "1F919732251A207B",
      "text": "超能魔法幻妆师莉普……\\n要挑战这个道馆馆主吗？",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "DECODED",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": []
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 2,
      "label": "gym_esper_040_receptionist_02",
      "hash64": "1F919832251A222E",
      "text": "那好，我带你去对战场吧。",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "DECODED",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": []
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 3,
      "label": "gym_esper_040_receptionist_03",
      "hash64": "1F919932251A23E1",
      "text": "等你准备好了，\\n随时都可以告诉我。",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "DECODED",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": []
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 4,
      "label": "gym_esper_040_esper_entry_01",
      "hash64": "EA01E71F5103C776",
      "text": "是啊……知道了。\\n我来办就好。[VAR 0x0114(002C)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 15,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "002C"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 5,
      "label": "gym_esper_040_esper_entry_02",
      "hash64": "EA01E61F5103C5C3",
      "text": "标语就用简单易懂的\\n“要美，还要美得自然”。[VAR 0x0114(002C)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 22,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "002C"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 6,
      "label": "gym_esper_040_esper_entry_03",
      "hash64": "EA01E51F5103C410",
      "text": "眼影的新颜色\\n也拜托你订货咯。[VAR 0x0114(002C)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 15,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "002C"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 7,
      "label": "gym_esper_040_esper_entry_04",
      "hash64": "EA01EC1F5103CFF5",
      "text": "……总麻烦你，谢谢啦。\\n先这样，有事再联系～[VAR 0x0114(002C)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 22,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "002C"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 8,
      "label": "gym_esper_040_esper_01",
      "hash64": "A1A3806506F21EE3",
      "text": "你好～！[VAR 0x0114(002C)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 4,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "002C"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 9,
      "label": "gym_esper_040_esper_02",
      "hash64": "A1A3816506F22096",
      "text": "我是道馆馆主莉普。\\c\\n其实化妆师\\n才是我的正业呢。[VAR 0x0114(001C)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 9,
          "count": 1,
          "code_hex": "BE01",
          "args_hex": []
        },
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 27,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "001C"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 10,
      "label": "gym_esper_040_esper_03",
      "hash64": "A1A3826506F22249",
      "text": "凰檗对你的评价很高哦。\\n说你实力很～“大强”。[VAR 0x0114(001C)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 23,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "001C"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 11,
      "label": "gym_esper_040_esper_04",
      "hash64": "A1A3836506F223FC",
      "text": "呵呵……[VAR 0x0100(0000)]，\\n你真是个可爱的挑战者。[VAR 0x0114(001C)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 4,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0100",
          "args_hex": [
            "0000"
          ]
        },
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 21,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "001C"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 12,
      "label": "gym_esper_040_esper_05",
      "hash64": "A1A3846506F225AF",
      "text": "做完莉普我独创的体操后，\\n你们变得更美了，心里一定很高兴吧？[VAR 0x0114(001C)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 30,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "001C"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 13,
      "label": "gym_esper_040_esper_06",
      "hash64": "A1A3856506F22762",
      "text": "宝可梦的身体\\n也让你打理得很干净。\\r\\n……你有颗很棒的爱美之心呢。[VAR 0x0114(001C)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 17,
          "count": 1,
          "code_hex": "BE00",
          "args_hex": []
        },
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 35,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "001C"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 14,
      "label": "gym_esper_040_esper_06b",
      "hash64": "9B02AAAACD784500",
      "text": "[EMPTY 30]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "DECODED",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 0,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "BDFF",
          "args_hex": [
            "001E"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 15,
      "label": "gym_esper_040_esper_07",
      "hash64": "A1A3866506F22915",
      "text": "对于人和宝可梦来说，\\n仪表都是很重要的哦。[VAR 0x0114(001C)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 21,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "001C"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 16,
      "label": "gym_esper_040_esper_08",
      "hash64": "A1A3876506F22AC8",
      "text": "能让任何人都摇身一变的魔术。\\n……这就是化妆。\\r\\n……这就是美妆。[VAR 0x0114(001C)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 23,
          "count": 1,
          "code_hex": "BE00",
          "args_hex": []
        },
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 35,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "001C"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 17,
      "label": "gym_esper_040_esper_09",
      "hash64": "A1A3886506F22C7B",
      "text": "用莉普我的招式\\n把你的宝可梦变得更～美吧！！[VAR 0x0114(001C)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 22,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "001C"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 18,
      "label": "gym_esper_040_esper_10",
      "hash64": "A1A7056506F536B9",
      "text": "不但让我输了对战，\\n还在美丽这一点上和我不相上下……[VAR 0x0114(001C)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 26,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "001C"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 19,
      "label": "gym_esper_040_esper_11",
      "hash64": "A1A7046506F53506",
      "text": "你很不错……！\\n非常不错，嗯，完美……！[VAR 0x0114(001C)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 20,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "001C"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 20,
      "label": "gym_esper_040_esper_12",
      "hash64": "A1A7036506F53353",
      "text": "在你日后成为大人物之前，\\n也许莉普我该把你私藏起来？[VAR 0x0114(001C)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 26,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "001C"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 21,
      "label": "gym_esper_040_esper_13",
      "hash64": "A1A7026506F531A0",
      "text": "……不过，莉普我现在\\n应该重新磨练自己才是。[VAR 0x0114(001C)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 22,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "001C"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 22,
      "label": "gym_esper_040_esper_14",
      "hash64": "A1A7096506F53D85",
      "text": "[VAR 0x0100(0000)]，恭喜你。\\n我就用这保留到最后的姿势\\r\\n把这个道馆徽章奖励给你吧。[VAR 0x0114(001C)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 0,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0100",
          "args_hex": [
            "0000"
          ]
        },
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 22,
          "count": 1,
          "code_hex": "BE00",
          "args_hex": []
        },
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 39,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "001C"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 23,
      "label": "gym_esper_040_esper_badge",
      "hash64": "4A010119989BC04B",
      "text": "有[VAR 0x0200(0001)]个道馆徽章的话，\\n等级[VAR 0x0201(0002)]以下的宝可梦会更容易捉到，\\r\\n而且它们都会听你的话哦。[VAR 0x0114(001C)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 1,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0200",
          "args_hex": [
            "0001"
          ]
        },
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 16,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0201",
          "args_hex": [
            "0002"
          ]
        },
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 33,
          "count": 1,
          "code_hex": "BE00",
          "args_hex": []
        },
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 49,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "001C"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 24,
      "label": "gym_esper_040_esper_badge_all",
      "hash64": "AD2165F57B02D8E7",
      "text": "有８个道馆徽章的话，\\n不管是什么样的宝可梦都能捉到，\\r\\n而且它们都会好～好地听你的话哦。[VAR 0x0114(001C)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 26,
          "count": 1,
          "code_hex": "BE00",
          "args_hex": []
        },
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 46,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "001C"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 25,
      "label": "gym_esper_040_esper_waza",
      "hash64": "799E8E5F8222D3D9",
      "text": "只要好好锻炼躯干，\\n你也能把这个招式用得很溜的。[VAR 0x0114(001C)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 24,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "001C"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 26,
      "label": "gym_esper_040_esper_17",
      "hash64": "A1A7066506F5386C",
      "text": "你和莉普我的合照，\\n可不许上传到社交平台哦。[VAR 0x0114(001C)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 22,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "001C"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 27,
      "label": "gym_esper_040_esper_15",
      "hash64": "A1A7086506F53BD2",
      "text": "……又是出汗又是一通折腾，\\n都让我有点掉妆了。[VAR 0x0114(001C)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 23,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "001C"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 28,
      "label": "gym_esper_040_esper_16",
      "hash64": "A1A7076506F53A1F",
      "text": "我得赶紧补妆才行，\\n否则就会耽误后面的行程了。\\r\\n好了，辛苦你了～[VAR 0x0114(001C)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 23,
          "count": 1,
          "code_hex": "BE00",
          "args_hex": []
        },
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 35,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "001C"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 29,
      "label": "gym_esper_040_receptionist_04",
      "hash64": "1F919A32251A2594",
      "text": "恭喜！\\n你突破了焙固道馆！",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "DECODED",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": []
    }
  ]
}
